@inject IStringLocalizer<ModifiedMark> L

@* The mark of a datum the user changed since the record was read (visuel/saisie-album/contenu.md, données modifiées,
   decisions of the user, #355): a filled pill « Modifié », green, after the label of the datum, inside it, so that screen
   readers read the word with the label, the color not being the only signal. Written once, for every point of entry. *@
<span class="modified-mark">@L["Modified"]</span>
